d 'contdid': module for difference-in-differences with a continuous treatment
d
d Implements Callaway, Goodman-Bacon & Sant'Anna (2024, NBER WP 32117):
d continuous-treatment DiD with B-spline dose-response. Estimates the
d dose-response function ATT(d) and the average causal response ACRT(d),
d with cluster-bootstrap pointwise intervals, a multiplier-bootstrap
d uniform confidence band, and staggered adoption (gvar()).
d
d Author: Haoyu Niu
d Distribution-Date: 20261006
d Requires: Stata version 16
d
f contdid.ado
f contdid.sthlp
f bspline.mata
